title: "Open Shadow AI"
abstract: >-
  Self-hosted Shadow AI discovery and governance. Correlates DNS and proxy
  logs, Zeek/Suricata, an endpoint agent and Entra ID / Active Directory, with
  an explicit evidence level per finding, keeping presence separate from usage.
